msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was picturesque."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那真是如画一般的日常。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e914049eae57a78f1d7930bde6165d281679740b5b4e800e49b723327708b44
#. default-sha256: 266e73757ed99696665c6f3451668d3704f64e3f5289668f9a289eb1fcb15c1f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And you were always there with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫并且，没错，你一直在我身边陪伴着我。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DC2B4A05_1531_4721_B9A6_AB21828E1C77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69d53ab3c5df02f048cf86934f10b7cc60eef0278c10079ea3419eb11d0d36ad
#. default-sha256: f68fa2da06ed90e2e5adad1363091c42d2aca7ac0756da37fc520deb5534f7de
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DC2B4A05_1531_4721_B9A6_AB21828E1C77"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我曾以为会永远继续下去。"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我曾以为会永远继续下去。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86f72daeaf2dcd330dec05656333d20dcf678f0be5157315a2fc00a13d8139d7
#. default-sha256: 9c2fbb578e7af0729339cb25eaa2c808f1a2a9addef929ba7f52bef24be56d80
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Following my seventeenth birthday, though, I was met with a deluge of changes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫过了十七岁的生日后，⟪k:2⟫我的周围发生了巨大的变化。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b263b3e37d6363d9528618880de81ce12a056914ab24e0081bbbb9d6d5a5ea6
#. default-sha256: 27bd500bd29833a877def8acbf693f4fa634e8c1d5804108956241ea2abc59ee
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫First, Father fell ill... ⟪k:1⟫and passed away shortly thereafter...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With his death "
"came the question of who would be the next head."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫首先是父亲倒下了……⟪k:1⟫就那样溘然长逝……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫亲戚们开始商量关于继承人的事。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 189b4200eb2b95654ec09b235df3a24074aab2be1b5488473d467c3df9a97377
#. default-sha256: 493f86210538032cc0fffa6d53b8861a0ab328541fe641b35597a70263e015b2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was seventeen, by all means enough of an adult to handle things myself. ⟪k:1⟫Or, well, "
"that’s what I thought, anyway."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而且我已满十七，⟪k:1⟫已是可以作为大人独立的年纪。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫至少我是这么认为的——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d5f9f49119dbdd47c0231211092abe82c571fb2d30de0c027937c17d3ef9517
#. default-sha256: d8f72455f49c11e19d505b88cd0a9b2c30e68ac98c570bdf2608825a92bba578
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a small house, far from home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his way of making it hard for me to come back. "
"⟪k:3⟫Not that I had any intention of returning."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大概是想让我不能轻易回到家中吧。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫虽然，⟪k:3⟫我也没有要回去的打算……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e70d1851dd8a9d1cb39f06e621e3c22ec3935bd33fe8c1dcebfc5362b76bb48e
#. default-sha256: b9737b1a540b61cb6dc4fcbc4616460ba8d5b109b6eb1de3c56dbb0cd0cb0e00
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was you coming with me, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫奈莉，⟪k:1⟫你跟着我一起来到了这里。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76ef37bf6f894079a7882921bfe1310d1bdac3f155001a3341fdb9760b14fe51
#. default-sha256: 0f522d129ad51aed84e6e7f307e450d8c627ac7b226f5b9dcec13836784a68bb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yep, so it is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……啊，⟪k:4⟫是呢……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3516016bf673e0174fb5c27950e8be9e818087e54b41942434f1fb6a1bd10ddf
#. default-sha256: a2ff752db42d3ed85a5fc020fafac34874c8310faa96ed537f4d00a5ffaede29
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s amazing how... ⟪k:1⟫little there is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No big yard, no paintings, no vases "
"filled with colorful flowers,⟪k:4⟫no silver bowls full of fresh-picked fruit..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫真的是……⟪k:1⟫什么都没有呢。⟪k:2⟫没有宽敞的庭院、⟪k:3⟫没有画、⟪k:4⟫不仅没有插着花的花瓶，⟪k:5⟫"
"连装在银盘里的水果都——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c76f9a6c52bb6bd6dca3f7cb6581b74f8d7f6ab6d4dbbaa70cf278bbb9fba717
#. default-sha256: a8cd25b3014b954e1573ba088350b396b22010268532be45733d6eea0713caab
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll do whatever I can for you, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you hungry? I’m hungry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫奈莉也会为了哥哥大人而加油的。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫呐呐哥哥大人，⟪k:4⟫肚子饿了吗？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55770eefd310d4c4817cd341fe8f0a4aa7f86d235d9caf836870589991c838f5
#. default-sha256: 3542a500f8fa25b5ec4bdd0b4c406f9ceb5ef5edbbb2d493c31960167ab119b4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫yeah... ⟪k:5⟫a bit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫啊，⟪k:3⟫嗯……⟪k:4⟫稍微有点……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c51834c1c85fe3dab409e4a4e78f373648534a69b3c2173aac2c8d676b271beb
#. default-sha256: d6fcf7d69cb5fec4d1036c5953d0c6f225b772f5cab9d0225b068b4a2362570d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:3⟫You’ve got quite the sweet tooth.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You’re going to make "
"yourself sick like that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫啊哈哈……⟪k:3⟫别光做点心啊。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫那样的话，⟪k:6⟫马上就会弄坏身体的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 035791bc3eb3cbac70dcbb878cb919740a1c29eb288f7a5f2e198ba4d76826d4
#. default-sha256: 82e0bf6ddc33512b054c6eccbb0f9e0dfa8c2e96d58c9bd6e5ad8f3ab71a0b22
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nope. You’ve been frowny all day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不是的哦，⟪k:2⟫直到刚才为止，⟪k:3⟫都是一副十分痛苦的表情呢。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7a1381f3d057cc575be3c06576fb64048e1a0a84199af355fc5d557cfaca12a
#. default-sha256: e812ee1a1ecc80075bb64658e9fb8d133cca4a143b35d5bbafffb5b3735f0725
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whatever you say..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……这样啊……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca6142749232faf8e3994e89b700f797d72c0bd2f8eb4494b48102bf643578b9
#. default-sha256: 1034dfb4818a52f25ab5d3f2ca6f054da040da3b5c86726d8ed862fa85dfb132
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Forget about all that stuff at home.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We’ve got each other! We can do this!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫家里的事，⟪k:2⟫不管怎么样都好。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫只要我们还在一起的话，⟪k:5⟫无论发生什么都能克服"
"的！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_85C710CC_5FC8_4871_A087_9B1BF1901128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d588bc62b21f8d638079c9da2a0ffd2a9f9bda37aab88517c785823c70e4bcfe
#. default-sha256: b76a47ccac34b5a039c11e53e46694052acfa878cdc7a28dd65beff79d7e5dad
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85C710CC_5FC8_4871_A087_9B1BF1901128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’ll all work out, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll always be here for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫放宽心吧，⟪k:2⟫哥哥大人。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫奈莉会一直，⟪k:5⟫陪伴在哥哥大人的身边的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D01B5C2_D45E_475E_B13F_467EE109DEE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ee5b612d282fba3885f321351acbc6b03465fa51cb5fe6bba3bbf4cfef5097d
#. default-sha256: 12fdad3619d3e715f2c08c73c34fb6cd3dce2a486cc8d47742264cb408eb1206
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D01B5C2_D45E_475E_B13F_467EE109DEE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suppose so..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……的确是呢……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33cffa884ada85e8449312f3ed23fd1a749d9e9280b28bb92fb53d7a3afc57cc
#. default-sha256: 5796ebae27c6240ea29995910d24df40c7cc00f88189dd23a8b48d0bbf50d896
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My whole life had changed so abruptly, so dramatically,⟪k:1⟫that my mind just wasn’t able to "
"keep up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然我明白必须要有所行动，⟪k:1⟫可我的内心还没适应这突变的生活。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C48E29E4_2F8A_4181_BFEC_D4F2E839E1CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f488fb878e0c5cdce0c601503664fa3abd2b5243e572d7bdbafd7b13bbdcf27
#. default-sha256: 2dee0f61d7a1f888fab0b4f785a58ec8ee5b3a058e30f48fa882af9ab47c0658
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C48E29E4_2F8A_4181_BFEC_D4F2E839E1CF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Our new life together was quiet and unremarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫两人一同过着风平浪静的生活。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD5F140F_2A30_4E96_B8D2_45E6694D1B3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86244976016df259e640e3e06e5ab69110b33e79879e61c09131f04d7e87b636
#. default-sha256: 1444c4c8944e653c00966c46cc65e2d32757d0a026c066f806cbb0820205a549
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD5F140F_2A30_4E96_B8D2_45E6694D1B3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was... ⟪k:3⟫planning on using it for supper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不，⟪k:3⟫用它做菜吧。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDE67F71_752F_46B9_B0BF_974E59FB2505
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf148cf9899849fa770a66b3f0cdccd77dc10e1bda7e4b447f2835bb774ce53e
