msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_73427DE4_86F4_4374_BF45_C20454200F78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uhh, ⟪k:3⟫if I remember... ⟪k:4⟫the guy said you have to pluck its feathers, then "
"cut off its head and drain all the blood..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫啊，⟪k:3⟫我记得是先把羽毛拔了吧……⟪k:4⟫然后再把它的头砍下来，⟪k:5⟫接着得放血——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BA468D70_3326_41B2_B93D_17BDBE2EAD12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0201070799f3219366cdc4dfc454623f02a9b799add921ac80095c98657e915
