msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Yeah. Yeah, you will...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’ll be just fine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……嗯，⟪k:1⟫是啊……⟪k:2⟫一定……⟪k:3⟫没问题的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7656D0B4_D829_4428_A94D_D0D75FFC0FC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4322fa1dbeba7c138b5ec779a93f9465067ffdd33966896c6143c6eb97850e36
