msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s going to be back to normal soon..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我们的生活……⟪k:1⟫已经，⟪k:2⟫不会再起波澜了……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4968603cf910c7a41fa7c3b02276b7b195a7f7a0cf933573adab986498fd201
