msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……哪位……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0430c08e52beb7636726f96b994a8353bdca45df44df1aafeaa90abda451ea9d
